doc:Factsarticle_2026_Fouling schema1:description "Study classifies heat-exchanger damage into structural and technological categories, emphasizes fouling as a key source of thermal performance degradation, combines physical interpretation with dynamic modeling of pollutant medium response to pneumoshock excitation, and develops a pneumoshock cleaning device (PCD) for mechanical removal of deposits from narrow inter-tube spaces; quantitative before-and-after thermal performance validation is outside the scope of the study." .
_:b0aa27fdfdd53aa92f19b723c0f0fea1 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle_2026_Fouling schema1:description "Study classifies heat-exchanger damage into structural and technological categories, emphasizes fouling as a key source of thermal performance degradation, combines physical interpretation with dynamic modeling of pollutant medium response to pneumoshock excitation, and develops a pneumoshock cleaning device (PCD) for mechanical removal of deposits from narrow inter-tube spaces; quantitative before-and-after thermal performance validation is outside the scope of the study." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:a29edb0e0cee .
doc:FactsPcd schema1:description "Device developed for mechanical removal of deposits from narrow inter-tube spaces; developed as the main practical outcome of the article based on analytical and simulation results" .
